# optative_adv.voc — Optative adverbs (talvez, oxalá, tomara) that trigger the present subjunctive.
# Before 'sobre' they mark the subjunctive of sobrar (open-o VERB) → +6. Add
# optative/desiderative adverbs.
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

talvez
oxalá
tomara
quiçá
oxala
